  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "oliver",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "Was it a kiss?",
   "scene": 1,
   "id": "ep02_s1_03",
   "next": "ep02_s1_04",
   "background": "bg_club_office_morning",
   "ko": "키스였어?",
   "portrait": "oliver_standing_weary"
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "chloe",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "You’re letting strangers tell you what happened.",
   "scene": 1,
   "id": "ep02_s1_04",
   "next": "ep02_s1_05",
   "background": "bg_club_office_morning",
   "ko": "모르는 사람들이 무슨 일이 있었는지 정하게 두는 거야?",
   "portrait": "chloe_standing_guarded"
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "oliver",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "I’m asking you.",
   "scene": 1,
   "id": "ep02_s1_05",
   "next": "ep02_s1_06",
   "background": "bg_club_office_morning",
   "ko": "난 너한테 묻고 있어.",
   "portrait": "oliver_standing_weary"
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "ethan",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "Yes. It was.",
   "scene": 1,
   "id": "ep02_s1_06",
   "next": "ep02_s1_07",
   "background": "bg_club_office_morning",
   "ko": "맞아. 키스였어.",
   "portrait": "ethan_standing_confront"
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "chloe",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "You don’t get to speak for me.",
   "scene": 1,
   "directions": [
    "클로이는 이든을 돌아본다."
   ],
   "id": "ep02_s1_07",
   "next": "ep02_s1_08",
   "background": "bg_club_office_morning",
   "ko": "네가 날 대신해서 말할 자격은 없어.",
   "portrait": "chloe_standing_guarded"
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "ethan",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "Then stop making me part of a lie.",
   "scene": 1,
   "id": "ep02_s1_08",
   "next": "ep02_s1_09",
   "background": "bg_club_office_morning",
   "ko": "그럼 날 거짓말에 끌어들이지 마.",
   "portrait": "ethan_standing_confront"
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "sophie",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "Oliver, maybe we should talk outside.",
   "scene": 1,
   "id": "ep02_s1_09",
   "next": "ep02_s1_10",
   "background": "bg_club_office_morning",
   "ko": "올리버, 밖에서 얘기하는 게 좋겠어.",
   "portrait": "sophie_standing_watch"
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "oliver",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "In a minute.",
   "scene": 1,
   "id": "ep02_s1_10",
   "next": "ep02_s1_11",
   "background": "bg_club_office_morning",
   "ko": "잠깐만.",
   "portrait": "oliver_standing_weary"
  },
  {
   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "julian",
   "channel": "speech",
   "text": "Whoever took it stood by the lounge window. That narrows things down.",
